<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>智能新闻| smithsonianmag.com</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/rss/smart-news/</link><description>智能新闻的 RSS 提要</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:54:31 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>野生动物生物学家开始为害羞信天翁手工接种疫苗，以防止禽流感在塔斯马尼亚的传播</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/wildlife-biologists-start-vaccinating-shy-albatross-by-hand-taking-aim-at-the-spread-of-avian-flu-in-tasmania-180989684/</link><description>如果一切按计划进行，官员们希望为信天翁岛上多达 100 只大型海鸟接种疫苗，每只接种两剂疫苗。之后，他们计划使用远程摄像头和后续访问来密切关注鸟类</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:21:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/wildlife-biologists-start-vaccinating-shy-albatross-by-hand-taking-aim-at-the-spread-of-avian-flu-in-tasmania-180989684/</guid></item><item><title>裤子里的鸟：迈阿密机场查获两名男子被控走私 21 只禽类</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/birds-in-their-pants-two-men-accused-of-smuggling-21-avians-after-miami-airport-bust-180989670/</link><description>海关官员表示，他们在这两名男子乘坐从古巴起飞的不同航班降落后，发现了藏在衣服里的生物，目前尚不清楚这两起事件是否有关联。野生动物贩运是世界第四大有组织犯罪形式</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:52:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/birds-in-their-pants-two-men-accused-of-smuggling-21-avians-after-miami-airport-bust-180989670/</guid></item><item><title>北达科他州州长官邸的建筑工程意外出土了七具可追溯到该州早期定居的棺材</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/construction-work-on-the-north-dakota-governors-residence-accidentally-unearthed-seven-coffins-dating-back-to-the-states-early-settlement-180989686/</link><description>该墓地建于 1872 年，当时州首府俾斯麦还是一个名为埃德温顿 (Edwinton) 的小型边境社区。五年后，大部分（但不是全部）墓地被挖掘出来，为铁路让路</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/construction-work-on-the-north-dakota-governors-residence-accidentally-unearthed-seven-coffins-dating-back-to-the-states-early-settlement-180989686/</guid></item><item><title>观看年度野生动物摄影师大赛的获奖者，捕捉大自然的壮丽和戏剧性</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/see-the-stunning-winners-of-the-wildlife-photographer-of-the-year-contest-capturing-the-splendor-and-drama-of-nature-180989681/</link><description>这 19 张公认的图像突出了我们星球的多样性以及欣赏和保护自然世界的价值</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:50:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/see-the-stunning-winners-of-the-wildlife-photographer-of-the-year-contest-capturing-the-splendor-and-drama-of-nature-180989681/</guid></item><item><title>在土耳其海岸发现了世界上最古老沉船的新竞争者。它的古代货物是 4,700 年前的“时间胶囊”</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-new-contender-for-the-worlds-oldest-shipwreck-has-been-discovered-off-the-coast-of-turkey-its-ancient-cargo-is-a-time-capsule-from-4700-years-ago-180989682/</link><description>当这艘船沉入海底时，它可能正在穿越地中海运输大罐橄榄油或葡萄酒。一位考古学家“不敢相信里面还有多少”残留物</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:20:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-new-contender-for-the-worlds-oldest-shipwreck-has-been-discovered-off-the-coast-of-turkey-its-ancient-cargo-is-a-time-capsule-from-4700-years-ago-180989682/</guid></item><item><title>这幅文森特·梵高的画作已有 60 多年没有公开露面。它现在准备在即将举行的拍卖会上创下纪录</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-vincent-van-gogh-painting-has-not-been-seen-in-public-for-over-60-years-it-is-now-poised-to-set-a-record-at-an-upcoming-auction-180989680/</link><description>这位荷兰后印象派画家在他生命的最后几个月里创作了《盛开的栗树》。这件作品将作为“传奇”私人收藏的一部分进行拍卖，其中还包括塞尚和雷诺阿的作品</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:28:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-vincent-van-gogh-painting-has-not-been-seen-in-public-for-over-60-years-it-is-now-poised-to-set-a-record-at-an-upcoming-auction-180989680/</guid></item><item><title>两幅最近被盗的雷诺阿画作被发现藏在煤渣砖墙后面。法国警方利用DNA证据和车辆追踪破获此案</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-recently-stolen-renoir-paintings-were-found-hidden-behind-a-cinderblock-wall-french-police-used-dna-evidence-and-vehicle-tracking-to-crack-the-case-180989678/</link><description>这起失手的抢劫案于九月在法国里维埃拉的雷诺阿博物馆发生。法国当局逮捕了六人，并相信他们阻止了另一起“迫在眉睫”的盗窃案，可能发生在附近的一家现代艺术博物馆</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-recently-stolen-renoir-paintings-were-found-hidden-behind-a-cinderblock-wall-french-police-used-dna-evidence-and-vehicle-tracking-to-crack-the-case-180989678/</guid></item><item><title>埃及的考古学家发现了一座泥砖墓，里面有一首对古人父亲的令人心碎的挽歌</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-in-egypt-discover-a-mud-brick-tomb-featuring-a-heartbreaking-elegy-to-an-ancient-mans-father-180989677/</link><description>这首 19 行诗被刻在 Bir al-Shaghala 墓地的一块石板上。一位学者表示，这首哀歌“是一首极具文学性和原创性的警句”</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-in-egypt-discover-a-mud-brick-tomb-featuring-a-heartbreaking-elegy-to-an-ancient-mans-father-180989677/</guid></item><item><title>哀悼者将一个古老的吸管杯放在罗马幼儿的坟墓中。它可能是为了维持孩子的来世之旅</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/mourners-laced-an-ancient-sippy-cup-in-a-roman-toddlers-grave-it-may-have-been-meant-to-sustain-the-child-on-the-journey-to-the-afterlife-180989673/</link><description>十多年前在英国出土了被称为“tettina”的喷嘴杯碎片。最近已修复并首次展出</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:44:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/mourners-laced-an-ancient-sippy-cup-in-a-roman-toddlers-grave-it-may-have-been-meant-to-sustain-the-child-on-the-journey-to-the-afterlife-180989673/</guid></item><item><title>一群谷仓猫头鹰搬进了纽约市上西区，这可能是现代历史上第一个在曼哈顿筑巢的猫头鹰家族</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-family-of-barn-owls-has-moved-into-new-york-citys-upper-west-side-perhaps-the-first-to-nest-in-manhattan-in-modern-history-180989674/</link><description>这些长着羽毛的居民引起了广泛的关注，因为它们的物种被认为是城市中极其罕见的景象</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:25:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-family-of-barn-owls-has-moved-into-new-york-citys-upper-west-side-perhaps-the-first-to-nest-in-manhattan-in-modern-history-180989674/</guid></item><item><title>世界上最大的帽带企鹅群之一正在迅速缩小</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/one-of-the-worlds-largest-chinstrap-penguin-colonies-is-shrinking-fast-180989676/</link><description>扎沃多夫斯基岛是南美洲和南极洲之间的一个偏远无人居住的火山岛，根据一项新研究，2011 年至 2025 年间，该岛的帽带企鹅减少了 63%</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:23:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/one-of-the-worlds-largest-chinstrap-penguin-colonies-is-shrinking-fast-180989676/</guid></item><item><title>第二次世界大战期间，一架美国轰炸机坠入英国荒原，一名下士被宣布在行动中失踪。考古学家现在重新开始寻找他的遗骸</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/after-an-american-bomber-crashed-into-an-english-moor-during-world-war-II-a-corporal-was-declared-missing-in-action-archaeologists-have-now-revived-the-search-for-his-remains-180989672/</link><description>一架 B-24H 解放者号在大雾条件下坠毁，克拉伦斯·沃森 (Clarence Watson) 下士是这架 B-24H 解放者号上的 10 名美国飞行员之一。机组人员正在为“Carpetbagger 行动”进行训练，这是一项绝密行动，旨在深入纳粹占领的欧洲</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:58:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/after-an-american-bomber-crashed-into-an-english-moor-during-world-war-II-a-corporal-was-declared-missing-in-action-archaeologists-have-now-revived-the-search-for-his-remains-180989672/</guid></item><item><title>在西班牙的一个岩石庇护所中发现的史无前例的古代木制工具宝藏表明尼安德特人是熟练的木工</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/an-unprecedented-trove-of-ancient-wooden-tools-uncovered-at-a-rock-shelter-in-spain-show-neanderthals-were-skilled-woodworkers-180989668/</link><description>木制物品通常会很快分解，但周期性的洪水和水中的矿物质有助于在一个名为 Abric Romaní 的地点保存这些物品。考古学家记录了近 600 件木制品或其印记，其中 13 件明显是由人手塑造的</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:00:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/an-unprecedented-trove-of-ancient-wooden-tools-uncovered-at-a-rock-shelter-in-spain-show-neanderthals-were-skilled-woodworkers-180989668/</guid></item><item><title>在家族财富和 Instagram 的帮助下，Z 世代在艺术市场上大手笔花钱</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/with-the-help-of-family-wealth-and-instagram-gen-z-is-spending-big-in-the-art-market-180989664/</link><description>一项新的调查显示，20 多岁的高净值人群正在成为全球艺术品交易中最活跃的成员，其支出远远超过其他几代人。他们的习惯正在改变艺术世界的运作方式</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:19:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/with-the-help-of-family-wealth-and-instagram-gen-z-is-spending-big-in-the-art-market-180989664/</guid></item><item><title>这个撒丁岛小村庄可能是一个新的“蓝色区域”，并且可能蕴藏着女性长寿的秘密</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-tiny-sardinian-village-might-be-a-new-blue-zone-and-could-hold-the-secrets-to-female-longevity-180989660/</link><description>一项新研究显示，在意大利岛上的博洛塔纳小镇，约有 2,300 名居民，70 岁以上的女性活到 100 岁的可能性大约是美国女性的三倍</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-tiny-sardinian-village-might-be-a-new-blue-zone-and-could-hold-the-secrets-to-female-longevity-180989660/</guid></item><item><title>志愿者正在帮助发掘英格兰最古老的麻风病医院之一，让人们一睹中世纪时期麻风病受害者的待遇</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/volunteers-are-helping-unearth-one-of-englands-oldest-leprosy-hospitals-giving-a-glimpse-into-how-victims-of-the-disease-were-treated-in-medieval-times-180989665/</link><description>研究人员认为，建于 11 世纪或 12 世纪的圣婴医院可能拥有“带小院子的小房子”，可容纳多达 20 名麻风病患者。 “你需要有资源才能进入这里，”一位考古学家说。</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:13:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/volunteers-are-helping-unearth-one-of-englands-oldest-leprosy-hospitals-giving-a-glimpse-into-how-victims-of-the-disease-were-treated-in-medieval-times-180989665/</guid></item><item><title>工业化是否破坏了我们的微生物组？对南美洲和非洲农村觅食社区的一项新研究表明答案是肯定的</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/did-industrialization-gut-our-microbiomes-a-new-study-on-rural-foraging-communities-in-south-america-and-africa-hints-the-answer-is-yes-180989658/</link><description>两个群体——玻利维亚的提斯曼采集园艺者和坦桑尼亚的哈扎狩猎采集者——拥有超过 1,200 种肠道微生物。然而，据研究人员称，其中约 60% 的特征在生活在工业化地区的人们中很少见或不存在</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/did-industrialization-gut-our-microbiomes-a-new-study-on-rural-foraging-communities-in-south-america-and-africa-hints-the-answer-is-yes-180989658/</guid></item><item><title>在史密森保护生物学研究所的直播中观看五只可爱的新生猎豹幼崽的成长</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/watch-five-adorable-newborn-cheetah-cubs-grow-on-a-livestream-from-the-smithsonians-conservation-biology-institute-180989669/</link><description>这些健康活泼的小宝宝正在由初为人母的祖拉 (Zura) 照顾，公众可以通过在线猎豹幼崽摄像头了解它们的滑稽动作</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 21:05:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/watch-five-adorable-newborn-cheetah-cubs-grow-on-a-livestream-from-the-smithsonians-conservation-biology-institute-180989669/</guid></item><item><title>借助尖端技术，纽约现代艺术博物馆将打造一座数字沼泽，将您包裹在大自然中</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-digital-swamp-coming-to-new-york-citys-moma-is-made-to-envelop-you-in-nature-with-the-help-of-cutting-edge-technology-180989652/</link><description>“湿地”是丹麦艺术家雅各布·库斯克·斯廷森设计的高科技巡回展览的最新装置。它借助民间传说、音景和视频游戏软件，重建了被忽视的生态系统</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 20:39:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-digital-swamp-coming-to-new-york-citys-moma-is-made-to-envelop-you-in-nature-with-the-help-of-cutting-edge-technology-180989652/</guid></item><item><title>2026 年诺贝尔和平奖获得者纳维·皮莱在种族隔离的南非长大，是世界领先的人权法学家之一</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/raised-in-apartheid-south-africa-2026-nobel-peace-prize-winner-navi-pillay-is-one-of-the-worlds-leading-human-rights-jurists-180989667/</link><description>当皮莱得知自己获奖时，她正身处纽伦堡审判追究纳粹战犯责任的同一法庭。她的法律职业生涯致力于打击侵犯人权和大规模暴行</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 18:53:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/raised-in-apartheid-south-africa-2026-nobel-peace-prize-winner-navi-pillay-is-one-of-the-worlds-leading-human-rights-jurists-180989667/</guid></item></channel></rss>